}
```

![Screenshot 2024-12-07 122613](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/367d302f-6e23-411f-a080-46f6fb05a659)


### Neovim version

0.10.2

### Steps to reproduce


use mini.icons in neo-tree instead of devicons.

### Expected behavior

Directory icon should be changes acording to the name of the directory.

### Actual behavior

Same directory icon for any type of directory files.
